# GCL Premium Calculator

This is a Streamlit-based app for calculating insurance premiums using GCL rate tables.

## Formula

Premium = (Loan Amount / 100000) × Rate

## Features

- Fixed backend rate file
- Client uploads only loan data
- Supports:
  - Home Loan
  - Personal Loan
  - LAP
  - Business Loans
- Level & Reducing Cover

## Required Input Columns

- Customer Name
- Age
- Loan Amount
- Tenure Months


